## Changed

- Made `layerFromConfig` map Config-read failures to `MusicSessionConfigError` and route every decoded value through the shared `resolve` validation boundary.
- Reset daemon provider backoff after a valid snapshot. Snapshot callbacks only enqueue a reset signal; scoped Effect workers own the retry counter and Schedule-driven 1/2/4/8-second delays.
- Replaced invalidation-only poll versioning with a scoped, replaceable poll fiber. Every accepted authoritative state replaces the active 3/5/8-second Effect Schedule deadline.
- Corrected the listener documentation to describe its server-owned `FiberSet` accept lane.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/config.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/provider.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/server.ts`.

